  'angkor-wat-sunrise-25-days-temples-and-tonle-sap': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 10,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Phil", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-03", text: "Excellent tour by tour guide Pal and driver Mao. Very informative and looked after my well being throughout. Good job." },
      { author: "Michal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-08", text: "We started our journey on the first day with a visit to Tonle Sap Lake, guided by AJ. He took us through the floating village, explaining lifestyle of the residents. We saw floating homes, traditional fishing practices, and experienced local community. AJ also guided us through a bustling market nearby, introducing us to local produce and sharing stories about the vendors, which added a personal touch to the experience. The next two days were dedicated to exploring Angkor Wat with Pi. From the very start, Pi impressed us with his depth of knowledge. He answered all our questions, providing det" },
      { author: "Pannag", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-05", text: "Wonderful tour organised by Journey Cambodia. Mr Pal Saruon was a very lovely guide, explained the temples very well and in detail. Clicked very good pictures too. Mr. Keai was a very good driver. Gave us cold water and fresh cold towels after roaming around the temples in the heat! Excellent trip! Recommend it to anyone who’d like to explore the wonderful city of Angkor!" },
      { author: "Michał", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-16", text: "We took a 2.5 days tour with Journey Cambodia as our guide to Angkor Wat and Tonle Sap floating village community. It was absolutely amazing, and - thanks to the low season - almost a private tour. We could visit both the most popular temples and buildings of Angkor, and some less popular but interesting ones. Sam was very knowledgable guide, and was happy to share with us not only the history of Angkor but of Cambodia as well, as well as about current culture and traditions. On top of that, they made sure that we stay hydrated in the Cambodian heat, and every time we got back to the car we re" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-04", text: "我们的向导Saruon Pal非常耐心讲解景点和吴哥文化的知识，超级会拍照，性格很好👍 推荐推荐。 司机每次会在我们快走到出口的时候就提前开过来接，会送水和清凉小毛巾。 我们最后半天加了崩密列这个景点。三天玩下来非常舒适。" },
      { author: "Julia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-07", text: "Wir haben eine 2,5 Tagestour zum Angkor Wat und den Floating Villages gemacht und es hat rundum alles gestimmt. Wir wurden jeden Morgen von einem klimatischen Bus abgeholt, der uns auch zu den verschiedenen Stopps gebracht und abgeholt hat. Der Guide Pireak war sehr freundlich und hat uns umfassend und interessant über alles informiert. Der Fahrer Keal hat uns immer, wenn wir nach einem Stopp zurück zum Bus kamen mit nassen Handtüchern und kühlem Wasser empfangen. Alles in allem ist die Tour sehr empfehlenswert!" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-24", text: "Such a fun tour! Met really nice people and the temple and the floating villages are just amazing. Really had a good time 😊✨Sokpee Sumsot was a really nice and kwowledgeable guide and Ro the driver handed out water and refreshing towels at any stop… Really enjoyed the 2,5 days. Do not hesitate to book ☺️✨😎" },
      { author: "Herbert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2022-10-31", text: "It was an amazing experience! The entire complex of Angkor is absolutely marvelous! Our guides, Sam and Usa, were always very attentive and kind. Always ready to answer all of our questions and provide us with valuable informantion about the History and culture of the Khmer people." },
    ],
  },
