  'koh-ker-and-beng-mealea-temple-guided-tour': {
    averageRating: 4.83,
    totalReviews: 38,
    guideRating: 4.96,
    valueRating: 4.79,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Monique", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-23", text: "Had an amazing time on this tour, so much fun exploring without many people from Angkor Wat. One of the less visited but equally fantastic temples! Our driver Kosal was an excellent and safe driver all day long, our guide Sambin was just fantastic with knowledge and tales of the past. Transportation was soooo comfortable and we all dozed off at some point from all the excitement of the day. Only disappointment was having to pay extra $15 each at Koh Ker but luckily Beng Mealea was included in our Angkor passes. Would definitely recommend this trip for all visitors that want to explore without" },
      { author: "Kirsten", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-26", text: "A great tour! Seng heal is an incredibly knowledgeable guide, and was able to answer the many questions I had about temples, Cambodian history (ancient and modern) and general info about Cambodian culture. Kosal as the driver was lovely. Having the air con car and the water top up made a hot day very comfortable. Highly recommend!" },
      { author: "Alexa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "Kim was fantastic! A great day exploring incredible places. Highly recommend!" },
      { author: "Alexandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-23", text: "Amazing day exploring the Koh Ker park! Sangheak and Sokhai as guide and driver were wonderful. So much knowledge and passion. I ended up having a private tour as I was the only one booked and the guys tailored it perfectly to what I was interested in. 10/10 recommend." },
      { author: "ding", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-19", text: "Sengheak is really nice and kind. Driver is Kosal who is also kind. Worthy and happy day" },
      { author: "Di", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-05", text: "It was an amazing trip. My tour guide Sengheak and driver Kosal knows everything about the temples, history and culture, and the car is AC powered and very comfortable. Would definitely recommend this tour to anyone." },
      { author: "Cia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-31", text: "Senghor was a wonderful guide, really informative, friendly, and gave me the perfect balance of accompanied guiding and free time to explore. Beng Mealea is a lovely jungle ruin! Being the off-season, I was the only one on this trip, and thankfully it still went ahead regardless!" },
      { author: "Rado", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-26", text: "The trip was great and easy, pick up from the hotel, great communication and pleasant journey. Since I've already seen Beng Mealea before, I was only focusing on th Koh Ker piramide which looks amazing. If you can plan your trip to visit the site after monsun season when all the jungle is lush green the it's even better. Thank you so much for a great time" },
      { author: "Annelien", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-30", text: "We had such a fun day, everything was perfect. Our guide Sen was very informed, very funny and spoke very well English. We had more than enough time to take pictures and walk around to everywhere we wanted. In the end we forgot our wallet in the car and the driver found it and brought it all the way back to our hotel before we even knew it was missing. Thank you so much for everything!" },
      { author: "Qi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-15", text: "Mr Nary was a great guide! He gave us a nice introduction and showed us around. This tour is absolutely worth it! Mr Thun’s car is very comfortable, huge space and no smell. Really enjoys the experience!" },
      { author: "An", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-04", text: "Our join in tour to Koh Ker and Beng Malea was an unforgettable experience! As a small group of three (two adults and a toddler) and despite that we were the only people for this tour, we truly appreciated the flexibility and comfort of the tour. Everything was well-organized, and the car provided was fairly new, with excellent air conditioning—perfect for Cambodia’s hot, warm humid weather. We had plenty of time to explore the breathtaking archaeological sites and enjoy the natural scenery without feeling rushed. The highlight of the tour was our guide, Chai. He is incredibly knowledgeable an" },
      { author: "Christine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-04", text: "I really enjoyed my this private tour. Very comfortable van, nice guide and driver." },
    ],
  },
