    guideRating: 4.33,
    valueRating: 4.11,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Mary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-01", text: "Sokneang is such a lovely guide! I booked the tour last minute but the company and Sokneang were incredibly accommodating and providing me with an a great tour around Phnom Penh. Sokneang is very knowledgeable and his humour really made the trip fun and memorable. I highly this excursion if you’re looking to explore and learn about the history of Phnom Penh." },
      { author: "Flora", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-10", text: "The tour was great and peaceful ! The guide was very kind and attentive to our needs. Thank you so much !" },
      { author: "Julie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-03", text: "Martin made our tour very enjoyable. He was very knowledgeable about the history of his country and the sites we visited. His English was amazing." },
      { author: "Peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-28", text: "Amazing trip and a lovely tour guide July (I can’t pronounce or spell his correct name!). July had so much knowledge to share and took us to some fantastic locations. It was very relaxing to see Phnom Penh via a Tuk Tuk and the driver was lovely too - it felt very safe. It was really interesting seeing little Paris and the differences between the old and new parts of Phnom Penh. Would highly recommend this tour. Thank you so much July 😊" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-08-17", text: "Our Tuk Tuk driver was very friendly and helpful. He took us on afterwards when requested. However, this tour didn’t include any information about where we visited. We were dropped off then picked up. This was fine for us- but if you want a tour that has a tour guide this isn’t the one." },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-06-19", text: "Nous avons pu visiter les sites à notre rythme, le conducteur du tuk-tuk nous attendait à chaque étape." },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-03-06", text: "The Palace and temple were lovely. The market was interesting. There wasn't a lot to the independence statue. The tour only lasted about three hours which makes it a bit hard to justify the price. Yes, it was very hot, but I would have preferred to spend a bit more time in the tuk tuk just driving around and taking in the city, to get a real feel for the place and to feel like I had better value for money." },
      { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2025-02-15", text: "The driver was great, however it was expensive for what it was. You’re better off just getting a Tuktuk from place to place for a couple of dollars. €19 each without a guide is a rip off. We were done in a couple of hours. Don’t recommend at all. Again, no reflection on the driver, he was very nice." },
      { author: "J", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-15", text: "Het voelt veilig bij hem in de tuktuk, ondanks de verkeerschaos. Hele fijne manier van in een korte tijd wat must sees af gaan." },
      { author: "Chris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2024-11-21", text: "Tuk tuk driver was very accommodating but in retrospect I should have arranged a guided tour" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-16", text: "Martin was a great guide!" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2024-02-13", text: "La guide était très bien mais je croyais avoir un guide francophone, comme il était marqué." },
    ],
