  'angkor-wat-highlights-and-sunrise-guided-tour-siem': {
    averageRating: 4.88,
    totalReviews: 1607,
    guideRating: 4.88,
    valueRating: 4.8,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Natasha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-31", text: "This tour was an incredible experience! A great way to see some of the amazing temples in Cambodia. Sadly it was too cloudy for us to see the sunrise, but the rest of the tour absolutely made up for it. The tour guide Mr Pal was incredible, he has so much knowledge to share! I travelled alone and he made sure to snap some pictures for me, which was very appreciated. The driver Ha was very kind and courteous also. A wonderful experience!" },
      { author: "Gary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-07", text: "it was very personal and the guide was absolutely amazing" },
      { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-10", text: "PAL was a great guide. Very informative. Saw some amazing sights. Highly recommended." },
      { author: "Shaun", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-21", text: "Amazing experience, Mr So is an exceptional tour guide providing a plethora of insightful facts and details about the history of the temples that we visited. Highly recommend, one of the most beautiful experiences you can enjoy! Sambath was our amazing driver (and water provider)!" },
      { author: "Mary", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-03", text: "Our guide Sak was extremely knowledgeable and made sure that we arrived early so that we had an excellent position to view the sunrise. Sak took us to see 3 temples and he was able to tell us about the history, architecture and culture of each one. The trip was paced well and we were well supplied with cold water and even cold flannels to help with the intense heat. Being collected and returned direct to our hotel was great. I would really recommend this trip it was an experience of a lifetime." },
      { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-30", text: "excellent guide. really insightful. we thoroughly enjoyed our day" },
      { author: "Meagan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-30", text: "Mr. Pal was a very thoughtful guide that is passionate to share Cambodian history and culture! We went as a couple on our honeymoon and he took the time to take fun photos shots. The tour was organized and on time, on hot dry season day in late March they had cold waters and the van was comfortable and air conditioned. The tour was paced to show us a lot of the highlights in Angkor Wat and surrounding temples but also allowed us rest stops and breaks to explore. This was a perfect tour for us!" },
      { author: "Evgenija", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-15", text: "This was a very beautiful tour! We were a group of 12 people. To watch the sunrise, we arrived at 5:00 AM to Angkor Wat and our guide Bun showed us the best spots so we could take wonderful photos. He explained a lot about the history of the temples as well as the religious background, pointed out many details, and organized everything perfectly in terms of timing. He also took great photos for us.Our driver Mao provided us with water and refreshing towels and made sure that the bus was always parked right next to the exits and well cooled down – which was priceless on such a hot day. Thank yo" },
      { author: "Joanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-12", text: "Fantastic trip out - got the best spot for sunrise over Angkor Wat and visited a further 2 temples with excellent guidance from Bun. He gave interesting, informative and open guidance on the sites visited and made sure we were looked after at all times. We were not rushed and given opportunity to explore certain areas for longer. Vireak our driver (apologies if name wrong) was also fantastic making sure we had plenty of water and fearful smelling cold hand towels each time we came back from a site to the transport." },
      { author: "Clarissa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-27", text: "Great half day with an experienced guide and very good driver. A relatively small group and we all had fun! Learned a lot too. And our guide Mr Hang was very good with iPhone pictures!" },
      { author: "Ivan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-21", text: "Great organization by the whole team! The guide was super knowledgeable and the driver was very well prepared with a cold towel and cold water every single stop. I very highly recommend this tour as the people are doing an amazing job!" },
      { author: "Jen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-09", text: "Fantastic day, our guide Mr Sokpee was knowledgeable, interesting & friendly, he took us to all the best spots and was a great photographer too. Our driver was also really friendly and helpful, always ready with cold towels and cold water as we got back to the bus! Would recommend this tour and our guide/driver especially" },
    ],
  },
