  'make-essential-oil-with-a-village-herbalist-near-p': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 13,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Desiree", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-04", text: "Lovely and welcoming family where you instantly feel part of. Our guide spoke English fluently and she explained the process of our oil production throughly; I feel confident to do it at home now. An unforgettable experience in an relaxing environment by a host who creates with passion!" },
      { author: "Marla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-12", text: "such an amazing welcoming experience. great for solo travellers and groups. I had so much fun making the oil and trying my best to make the gift box to go with it. the hospitality and kindness was definitely the highlight of my visit and trip. thank you so much!" },
      { author: "Carol", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-22", text: "We really enjoyed the morning with this exceptional family making organic lemon grass oil as well as some optional weaving or massage. The village is not far from the city but far enough away to give a taste of village life. Highly recommended" },
      { author: "Steve", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-04", text: "Wow! One of the best unexpected trips we have been on. The rustic ferry crossing takes you from the heart of the city to the countryside in 10 minutes, to a really smart family home and farm where you can see how the lemongrass is grown and the lengths they have to go to in order to produce the oil. We contacted the host directly in advance to arrange a slightly later, more relaxed start which she was happy to do. But there are more surprises - the family members also acted as guides to an enchanting area with old and new temples only a short distance away, and the hosts daughter also delivere" },
      { author: "Adriana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-03", text: "Son una familia molt amable que fan els olis essencials completament naturals. L'experiència és molt divertida i s'hi està molt a gust. Tenen un munt de gossets super simpàtics i van tenir un munt de detalls amb nosaltres (ens vam endur sucre de canya, aloe vera, oli essencial, spray per a roba...)" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-08", text: "こちらの我儘で時間をずらして貰いました。 精油作りはレモングラスを細かく切るところからやらせてもらえます。 凄く楽しかったです。 10mlの精油とハイドロゾルを使ったスプレーがついてきました。 店主さんが作ったお洒落な箱にいれてくれました。 また機会があれば行きたいです！" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-03", text: "Absolutely loved it! Sophors is passionate about what she does which makes the activity even more enjoyable. I learnt how to make a little box and got to see the entire process of essential oil making (which I will try at home!). An amazing and fun activity!" },
      { author: "Zitouni", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-22", text: "L'activité à été incroyable. En plus de la conception d'huile essentielle, on a confectionné un petit panier en feuille de palmier. Notre hôte était vraiment super. Je recommande vivement" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-17", text: "Had great fun and conversation with the family :) Besides learning about lemongrass, I also learnt about Cambodia and the people from them. Would strongly recommend!" },
      { author: "Gloria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-30", text: "Die Gastfreundlichkeit und auch das Engagement der Gastgeber sich immer mehr aufzubauen! :)" },
      { author: "Gabriella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-14", text: "Dit was echt het leukste wat ik heb gedaan in de omgeving van de hoofdstad van Cambodja! Dikke aanrader!!" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-30", text: "Really good activité to get out of the busy city. Sophors and her famille were very kind. Clear instruction on how to get the ferry (for When would be worried). I would 100% recommand if you are in Phnom penh !" },
    ],
  },
