    totalReviews: 12,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Joseph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-05", text: "This was a cool way to pass the day. Started with the hero rat experience and then ravy took us to some different places like a local market, Buddhist temples and told us about siem reip and daily life here." },
      { author: "Lukas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-22", text: "Ravy did a very good job. If you wanna explore Siem Reap with a local guy, he is your man." },
      { author: "Ryan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-28", text: "This was my first tour here in Siem Reap and I absolutely enjoyed it. Tour guide was Ravy and he was great knowledgeable and friendly. 100 percent recommend this tour." },
      { author: "Nadja", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-04", text: "We spent a very nice afternoon with Ravy and our driver Mr. So. It was very interesting and we learned a lot of Cambodian Culture and history. Highly recommend the Tour." },
      { author: "Aleksandr", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-28", text: "We had an amazing Vespa tour in Siem Reap with our guides Chomreun and Ravy! It was such a fun and authentic experience — riding around the city on Vespas, exploring local places, learning more about Cambodian culture, and enjoying the atmosphere of Siem Reap. Chomreun and Ravy were super friendly, professional, and made us feel safe and comfortable the whole time. We had a really great time, lots of laughs, and beautiful memories from this tour. Highly recommended if you want to see Siem Reap from a different and more local perspective!" },
      { author: "Sinead", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-24", text: "The tour was very good revy was a lovely tour guide and was very informative throughout the tour. I learned a lot and really enjoyed it. I Would recommend !!" },
      { author: "Poo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-04-28", text: "It was great… Fun tour with Tuktuk, and the guide + driver were very attentive. Overall, it was very enjoyable. However, the OPOPO bit felt very very rushed… We were rushed in, and rushed out and were not allowed quality time with the hero demining rats…!!! It actually spoilt the whole tour for me. You should feed back to the APOPO staff that they should not treat tourists like that! Very perfunctory, especially for people like me who love rats!" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-30", text: "Nice and very informative tour! Special thanks to Ravy and Mr. So :)" },
      { author: "FRIDA", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-29", text: "Mi guía fue Ravy, muy amable, me explicó todas mis dudas, el tour vale totalmente la pena 👌🏼" },
    ],
