  'angkor-wat-tour-privado-en-espanol-siem-reap': {
    averageRating: 5.0,
    totalReviews: 6,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Fernando", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "Excelente visita con un guía excepcional, recomiendable totalmente, si vas a Siem Reap no dudes en contactar con el" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Rinald es un guía muy profesional. Nos ha dado amplias explicaciones sobre las visitas culturales y nos ha ayudado en todo lo que hemos necesitado durante el viaje. Además, habla muy bien español." },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "Un guía 100% recomendable. La experiencia fue muy buena. El guía habla un español casi perfecto, tiene muy buen conocimiento de los templos, historia, cultura del país. Las visitas en todo momento fueron tranquilas y él nos iba a preguntar cada rato si queríamos estar más tiempo o no en los sitios. Te daba tiempo para que vieras y hicieras fotos de todo sin prisa. Nuestra recomendación es que si vais a Camboya contactéis con Choun Rinal hará para hacer las excursiones ya que te lo pone todo fácil y cómodo. Recomendamos ir a los templos con guía sin batantes templos para ver y que mejor que en" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "El mejor guía de Camboya en español! Nos encantó la visita a los templos más importantes de Camboya! El guía, Rinal, es fantástico y habla perfectamente español. Aprovechamos al máximo! Sin duda repetiremos!" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "Fantástico guía en Angkor. La visita con Rinal a Angkor ha sido una experiencia increíble. La pasión y veracidad con la que explica te atrapan a escuchar más y más historias de este precioso lugar. Se hizo muy ameno tanto para mayores como para los peques, que aprendieron un montón. ¡Gracias por tus conocimientos" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "Viaje espectacular a Siem Reap, Camboya! El viaje a Siem Reap fue una experiencia inolvidable! Camboya es un “must” que todo buen viajero debería hacer en su vida. La riqueza cultural de sus templos y la visión de la naturaleza entrelazados con los templos es única. Y si añadimos la amabilidad de su gente reflejada en sus guías como el que me atendió, Choun Rinal, que además habla español muy bien, el viaje permanecerá siempre en su retina!" },
    ],
  },
  'sunset-dinner-tour-tonle-sap-lake-floating-village': {
    averageRating: 4.26,
    totalReviews: 356,
    guideRating: 4.63,
    valueRating: 4.11,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Jayant", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-29", text: "The coordinator misguided the guide by giving him the wrong hotel name. I think my written and spoken communication is pretty good. I am deaf - but that is beyond my control." },
      { author: "Gabby", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-05", text: "It was awesome! Very beautiful views and exactly as advertised" },
      { author: "Conni", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-03", text: "this was an excellent tour and adventure. I was happy to meet a new friend and enjoy the beauty of the floating villages and Tonle Sap lake. learning about this area was very interesting, and seeing a floating market was quite unusual. The sunset and the moon on the lake were both beautiful!" },
      { author: "Maxine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "An was a delightful smiley,funny and informative guide. Food was great. unlimited drinks. Boat Queen Tara was awesome. 100 years old and full of character. Pretty special lying on an hammock in the sun listening to the water. All I will say is the boat was virtually empty which is sad I would really encourage people to do this trip as it is a unique experience." },
      { author: "Diane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-16", text: "Most enjoyable tour with a delicious sunset dinner. Highly recommend" },
      { author: "Ollie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-30", text: "Va was our tour guide for this and was great. Really warm and knowledgeable throughout the entire journey. Made a quick stop to see the Lotus Flowers, then the main event towards the floating village. Really great experience on the boat, the end buffet dinner on the stationary bigger boat was ok, was not helped too much with the weather, can imagine in season the sunset would have been spectacular. Would still recommend as a fun afternoon/early evening activity" },
      { author: "Trevor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-04", text: "more information about the lake and the marine life closer look at the floating villages and the water levels how the crocodiles are kept and looked after" },
      { author: "Norman", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-25", text: "Interesting tour that included a Lotus farm with stilted houses over the water. A small boat tour of the floating villages, moving 7 times a year as the water rises and falls including schools and churches! The Lara Queen was the large boat for our sunset dinner, it was rustic but a great location to see the sunset." },
      { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-18", text: "A very enjoyable late afternoon and early evening experiencing the floating village and enjoying a meal on the Tonle Sap lake watching the sunset. Good okay with plenty of drinks. Our guide Hong or was it Hung 😱😂 made it an enjoyable experience." },
      { author: "Carla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-12-14", text: "Excellent tour! Totally recommend it. Tino is a very good guide and so funny. I had a wonderful evening" },
      { author: "Phil", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-24", text: "Great fun, picked up on time, nice vehicle, explained the program, stopped a couple of times on the bus, may have bee good to be able to try the local food at the side of the road, but no big deal. Small boat for a trip to the Queen Tara was great fun, I sat on the roof. Croc farm was a little sad to see the conditions they are kept in, but no fault of the trip, then to Tara, lovely old boat. Nice food no restriction on what you ate or drank. Super sunset, watched with a cocktail in hand to good music." },
      { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-04-28", text: "The tour was exactly as described and great value for money. Our guide was good and informative. Dinner on the Queen Tara was a good Cambodian spread of food." },
    ],
  },
