  'personalized-angkor-wat-sunrise-by-tuk-tuk': {
    averageRating: 4.92,
    totalReviews: 51,
    guideRating: 4.95,
    valueRating: 4.73,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Allan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-19", text: "Fantastic full-day Angkor experience We did the full-day tour covering Angkor Wat at sunrise, Angkor Thom, Bayon, and Ta Prohm — the pace was perfect, unhurried but efficient enough to see it all in one day. Our guide was incredibly knowledgeable and our driver was friendly throughout. Highly recommend for anyone wanting a thorough introduction to Angkor." },
      { author: "Brianna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-21", text: "Makara made this early wake up worth it! He was such a good and informative guide. His knowledge is unmatched, he seemed to know everything about the temples and was so excited to share his country with us. I’d highly recommend this tour, especially if he’s your guide." },
      { author: "Phillip", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-16", text: "This was a wonderful personalised tour of Ta Prohm Temple and Angkor Wat. The guide was perfect and very knowledgeable and gave me a wonderful overview of the history of these 2 temples. It was very hot when we started at Ta Prohm Temple at about 3 pm but the tuktuk driver provided ice cold water before and afterwards. 3 hours was a good length. Thank you for a wonderful experience." },
      { author: "Blake", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-09", text: "Seyha was an incredible guide. Very knowledgeable, kind and enthusiastic. His English is just perfect and he really made our tour to Angkor Wat memorable! So worth it to have a private tour and get a one on one experience. The temples are just incredible and the sunrise was magic. Thank you for a great day and memories that will last a lifetime!!! Very grateful" },
      { author: "Ben", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-18", text: "Naga was a fantastic guide, on time with a friendly face at 5am. Lots of useful information and background about the ancient city we’d never have got had we tried to guide ourselves. Obviously, the sunrise was stunning, but the tour itself, in which we hit 7-8 different locations with ample time to explore ourselves, was perfect. Also, Naga is an absolute whizz with an iPhone so you’ll get some great images" },
      { author: "Kelly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-30", text: "Fantastic tour! Tom was great and very informative. We are engaged and thought about booking a photo shoot somewhere on our travels, but Tom knew all the places and angles to get so it doubled as a photo shoot and was worth it for that alone! He gave intricacies of the constructions and stories told on the walls that we wouldn’t have had otherwise. Driver was kind, gave us cold water, and was always Johnny on the spot!" },
      { author: "Sheryl", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-17", text: "Ra (Chhim Malaya) was extremely knowledgeable and personable. He provided clear, concise in depth information about the deep, cultural heritage, the struggles to build the structures, and the purpose behind everything. He was able to explain the carvings, help us understand the story, and appreciate the Khmer history. We highly recommend his guiding expertise, and we plan to share his information with any of our friends who plan to travel to Cambodia in the future. His English was excellent and his fun personally made for a great experience He also took the BEST photos of us" },
      { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-16", text: "Very enjoyable and fun morning. My tour guide Naga was very informative and our driver of the Tuk Tuk did an amazing job, Siem Reap and Angkor Wat, great places to visit on any holiday to Cambodia." },
      { author: "Zana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-13", text: "I had a fantastic experience with Mr Long! We headed for sunrise in Angkor and proceeded to two more temples. Mr Long is experienced, pleasant and knowledgeable, answered all of my questions, let me explore and take my time with photos, showed me best spots and made sure water and cold towels are waiting for me after every temple. 10/10 would recommend and hopefully will come back one day!" },
      { author: "Chantelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-05", text: "Our tour guide was very knowledgeable and let us take our time with photos and gave recommendations on where to take the best photos. He was also willing to extend our tour by stopping at some of the famous gates and allowing us to see an extra temple. Really enjoyed the experience." },
      { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-18", text: "Amazing depth of knowledge that enhanced the magic of the history. Excellent english." },
      { author: "Caroline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-07", text: "Had a fantastic morning with the very knowledgeable and lovely John, who educated us not just about the temples we visited but also about so many aspects of local life, Hinduism and Buddhism. Our driver Sopheak was also excellent in every way. I cannot recommend this tour highly enough. It is worth every cent. Thank you John and Sopheak for an outstanding morning." },
    ],
  },
