  'phnom-tamao-wildlife-center-and-buddha-kiri-cambod': {
    averageRating: 4.76,
    totalReviews: 12,
    guideRating: 5.0,
    valueRating: 5.0,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Sha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-14", text: "The guide Mr Reaksa Sem was very knowledgeable & shared alot of information about the culture of cambodia & the Killing Field and S21 Genocide Museum. His experiences shared was valuable & insighful. He answered all our questions. We recommend his expertise to all tourists. The driver was also patience and waited for us to complete each location." },
      { author: "Debra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-10", text: "Tokk and forgive me for not remembering the driver’s name were great and extremely helpful. It was the extra things that made the whole trip more enjoyable like the snacks, local lunch and even going out of his way to buy us socks for the hot floor. He explained everything whilst keeping it interesting. Still a way to go regarding the conservation but all in the right direction. A lovely day was had." },
      { author: "Kevin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-03", text: "Really enjoyed visiting was nice to see some conservation being done with some animals the keepers are really passionate about it Enjoyed the temples as well (considering we have seen so many over three weeks) The guide Tokk really made it special with his knowledge of the tour and the history of the country 5 stars Also a very good driver called Tia" },
      { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-03", text: "I had an absolutely wonderful time on this trip! The wildlife center was truly amazing—such a unique and memorable experience. The temples we visited were breathtaking, each one more beautiful and fascinating than the last. The history and architecture left a lasting impression. A special shout-out to my guide, Tokk. He was incredibly friendly, knowledgeable, and always ready to help. His passion and expertise made the trip even more special. I can't recommend him highly enough!" },
      { author: "Lynne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-28", text: "It was fantastic. Tokk, my guide knew so much, his Englush was very good, nothing was too much trouble and he was very good at spotting the animals. Rain, my driver, was an excellent driver and I loved all the cold face washers he gave me to keep me cool." },
      { author: "Murdena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-06", text: "Perfect day,our guide was fantastic,so knowledgeable and helpful,safe driver. Conservation is in its early days here,it’s a good start. The temple and Buddhas were just breath taking,beautiful scenery throughout the day.A country in recovery wishing you the best future,you have so much to offer 💕" },
      { author: "Paul", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-12", text: "I had a great time experiencing this side of Cambodia. Lee Song was a great guide, so personable and friendly. As a solo traveller, he made me feel comfortable and relaxed. I highly recommend this tour if you want to see a sanctuary and 84,000 Buddhas in 1 temple" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-26", text: "Activité très intéressante qui permet de découvrir plusieurs aspects du Cambodge Les explications du guide sont très claires et permettent de bien appréhender les différentes périodes historiques du pays" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-08-17", text: "The guide Tokk and driver Rith were punctual, and very nice. Tokk was knowledgeable about both local and nation's culture and history." },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-07-27", text: "It was good to see the animals being looked after." },
    ],
  },
