  '2-day-angkor-wat-with-sunrise-small-group-tour': {
    averageRating: 4.93,
    totalReviews: 242,
    guideRating: 4.96,
    valueRating: 4.99,
    reviews: [
      { author: "joao", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "The tour with Pal Sauron was amazing. It was such a complete experience, his explanations were great, he always gave us enough water and refreshments, besides taking the best pictures ever. I felt like I was in the Khmer period during this tour, which is the best one I did in Southeast Asia." },
      { author: "Nick", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-31", text: "We really enjoyed the 2 day tour. The temples selected were perfect and our guide, Bun, was really knowledgeable, especially with the historical facts. Naro is an excellent driver who also kept us supplied with water and towels at every stop. Thank you very much! Nick & Mari" },
      { author: "Gustavo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-25", text: "Mr. Pal Saruon was amazing! Really professional and well explained! He has an iPad to explain and to complete the story ! The driver, Naro was súper friendly and safety! We really recommend this guide !" },
      { author: "Thomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-24", text: "We had an amazing two-day Angkor tour and can highly recommend it! The organization was excellent from start to finish. Everything was well planned, and the timing allowed us to experience the temples without feeling rushed. Our guides Mr. Sokpee and Mr. Pal Saruon were very knowledgeable and shared interesting insights about the history, culture, and symbolism of the temples, which made the experience much more meaningful. Highlights for us were the sunrise at Angkor Wat, the impressive faces of Bayon, and the unique atmosphere at Ta Prohm. Each temple had its own character, and the tour was" },
      { author: "Kyle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "Absolutely amazing 2 day trip around the temples, some incredible place I never would have gone too, Pal was an excellent, very knowledgeable and interesting to speak also shout out to Vrak who was a great driver and supplies endless water 😃" },
      { author: "Rashim", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-06", text: "It was very professionally conducted and our guide PAL SARUON was extremely knowledgeable also. Gave ample time at all the places.. The driver VERAK was also very sweet and polite." },
      { author: "Mara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-25", text: "I really enjoyed the tour. I saw both sunrise and sunset. The guide Mr. Pheap Rath was attentive and patient. He waited for me after sunset and always informed me by phone where he was, because there were a lot of people and I could get confused and go the wrong way. Pheap Rath always showed me the best places to photograph the sunrise. He took pictures of each of us separately and the whole small group of 4-5 people together and sent the photos to everyone on WhatsApp after the tour." },
      { author: "jocelyn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-22", text: "This tour exceeded my expectations. Our guides Bun and Sam, plus our driver Vireak were excellent, and gave us a really good comprehensive overview of the temples and history of the Angkor empire. Vireak greeted us with an ice cold bottle of water and cold towels as we returned from of our temple tours, and drove us around some quite rough roads with skill and ease. Bun and Sam were excellent guides, making sure we saw the best of each temple and giving us adequate free time to explore afterwards. The sunset was amazing, we arrived in time to grab a good spot, and the sunrise was unbelievable." },
      { author: "Alexandru", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-05", text: "Paul and the driver Naro were great hosts! I learned a lot about Cambodian, Hindu and Buddhist history. Paul was very friendly and knowledgeable, always happy to answer questions. He also took a lot of pictures of us - professional photographer :D If you come to Siem Reap and are looking for a great tour in the Angkor Temple area, I highly recommend this 2-day tour." },
      { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-02", text: "Our visit to Angkor Wat and several surrounding temples was a very special experience. We had originally booked a two-day tour, but unfortunately we became ill beforehand and were only able to join for one day. The team was extremely understanding and even offered us the opportunity to make up the second day. Sadly, we didn’t have enough time left in Siem Reap to reschedule, but we truly appreciated the flexibility and kindness. Our guide, Bun, shared a lot of interesting background information in a clear and engaging way, which helped us better understand the history and meaning of the temple" },
      { author: "Eva", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-24", text: "I had Delign as my tour guide for both days, and I really enjoyed my experience! He was very knowledgeable about the area, gave great information and took amazing photos! Definitely worth the price. Thank you, Delign!!" },
      { author: "Tara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-13", text: "I was so excited to see the temples and we had a great 2 days. First day is long but we saw so much. The highlight is day 2 . Our guide was very knowledgable and helpful. The whole family enjoyed this." },
    ],
  },
