    reviews: [
      { author: "Ben", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-26", text: "We had a wonderful day at the Kulen Mountain! Tann and Pan served us well. Tann was knowledgeable and planned an itinerary for us that kept us out of the crowds. Thank you for the wonderful day!" },
      { author: "Alison", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-15", text: "I booked this trip for myself, my husband and mother in law. It ended up being just us three for the day. It really was incredible. Our guide, Tann, went above and beyond. He gave us so much information about Cambodia and it's history and political landscape. We honestly didn't notice the time going by as we were enjoying ourselves so much. Every time we got back to the car there was cold water and a fresh towel waiting for us. It was bliss. We had a wonderful time at the waterfall and Tann took lots of pictures which he sent along to us afterwards. Definitely book this day trip!" },
      { author: "Koen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-25", text: "The waterfalls are impressive and beautiful and offer a refreshing swim! Our guide Tann took us to see the views in Kulen national park and was kind and helpful. He took some pictures for us and told us about Cambodian history and … A very nice trip do in the morning!" },
    ],
