  'phnom-penh-evening-food-tour-on-promotion-price-li': {
    averageRating: 4.94,
    totalReviews: 35,
    guideRating: 4.95,
    valueRating: 4.95,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Margaret", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "We were late but Sok waited for us; he had such a great attitude always looking for solutions to work around our requirements. We ate the most authentic Cambodian food on this holiday, cooked by locals the way they eat it. We had a lovely evening of sight seeing and taking photos with a guide that was not only friendly but mindful of our food preferences and gave reassurances of food hygiene to make us feel more relaxed. We enjoyed the food tour very much . Thank you Sok and the Tuk Tuk driver" },
      { author: "Elke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-31", text: "I had a fantastic street food tour with guide, Lee! He was friendly, knowledgeable, and made the experience so much fun. I got to try a great variety of delicious local dishes while learning more about Cambodian food and culture. I would definitely recommend this tour to anyone visiting Phnom Penh. Thanks, Lee, for a wonderful evening!" },
      { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-30", text: "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Our food tour in Phnom Penh with Tintin was hands down one of the absolute highlights of our trip to Cambodia. From the moment we met him, Tintin was warm, friendly, knowledgeable, and incredibly passionate about his city. He took us to places we never would have found on our own and introduced us to some of the most delicious, authentic Cambodian food we’ve ever tasted. Every stop had a story, and he explained the history, culture, and local traditions in such an engaging way that it felt like we were exploring Phnom Penh with a friend rather than just a tour guide. What truly sets Tint" },
      { author: "Edward", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-15", text: "We had an amazing tour with our very knowledeable guide Lee and his colleague tuk tuk driver. Because of the low season, it was just us two. Lee took us to some backstreet streetfood eateries and market stalls and introduced us to some very tasty Khmer food. The food businesses were all family run and some of them had been there since the 1980s. These are the spots that you want to discover as a visitor: frequented by locals and away from the beaten track. The hospitality and friendliness by which you are greeted is second to none and the flavours you get to experience are diverse and very nic" },
      { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-07", text: "Tin Tin is a great guide with a high level of knowledge and positive energy, and the reason why this food tour was such a success. Delicious food at every stop, at places we wouldn't go ourselves. Absolutely recommendable" },
      { author: "Courteney", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-01", text: "We enjoyed gaining the food knowledge of Cambodia through this experience. We got to try all the cuisines that are on offer and branch out of our comfort zone but feeling very safe. Sok was funny and so kind making sure we were comfortable and having fun throughout this experience. Sok really knew his stuff and was an awesome tour guide. Would highly recommend this experience." },
      { author: "Sophie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-17", text: "The tour was incredible, a really good way to learn about Khmer cuisine and local spots to eat. Our tour guide Sok was great, super friendly, it felt like going out for food with a friend. Would highly recommend to anyone visiting Phnom Penh." },
      { author: "Jaimee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-17", text: "5 ⭐ evening with Lee. He is the absolute best!! While we learnt a lot and tasted so many great foods, it also felt like we were hanging out with a friend. Thanks Lee!!" },
      { author: "Ellie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-15", text: "Tintin was amazing! He made the food tour so fun and taught me so much about the culture. He even took us to see a fireworks display for the king’s birthday. Only problem was how good at pool he is! We had such a lovely evening ONLY because of his excellent and professional manner" },
      { author: "Chanel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-10", text: "this was an excellent experience! Kim, our guide, was jovial and very knowledgeable. The food was delicious and unique. The tour well paced. I strongly recommend this!" },
      { author: "Ann", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-19", text: "Sok was attentive and professional. He made the tour fun and was very knowledgable the drivers were excellent too" },
      { author: "Allan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-19", text: "This was a great tour and a fun way to enjoy Cambodian cuisine in Phnom Penh. We were picked up by Tuk Tuk from our hotel and taken to the first of 6 stops, to meet our guide Sok, and the other 3 people on the tour in a small restaurant. We sampled green and red khmer curry with a range of vegetables, then on by tuk tuk to a roadside pancake stop, another restaurant for noodles and beer. A stop for ice cream at the night market another street vendor for beef skewers before finishing off in Bassac Street for drinks and a 'take away' bag of insects (the usual stall was closed apparently). All ve" },
    ],
  },
