  'sunset-kampong-phluk-floating-village-siem-reap': {
    averageRating: 4.87,
    totalReviews: 7,
    guideRating: 4.87,
    valueRating: 4.87,
    reviews: [
      { author: "Alice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-24", text: "We had an amazing tour with Lee. He was friendly and knowledgeable and was able to answer all our questions. We would highly recommend booking a tour with him!" },
      { author: "Pierre", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-20", text: "Lee wasn’t just a guide, he became a friend ! Arrived on time for pickup at the hotel, smiley all the time and very attentive! He even became a doctor when I needed it. The tour was very nice and informative although during the dry season the floating village has some lack of water, but when you get on the lake the view is marvelous. Lee offered as well to see the traditional Cambodian way of live and take me to the night shopping area. I recommend this tour very much that takes you out of the city giving you a good idea of the surroundings with the Cambodian nature and the rice fields." },
      { author: "Lau", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-04-01", text: "Selve turen var virkelig god, og vores guide havde virkelig styr på det! Det skal siges at vi bookede kun et par timer før turen begyndte, men vi fik ingen besked om, hvornår vi bille blive samlet op, før vi selv skrev til dem. De skrev så kl 15 men kl 14:20, da vi lige var vågnet fra en lur, ringede de og sagde, at det var nu. Så god tur, men ikke så god kommunikation" },
      { author: "Thomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-05", text: "toller und sehr sympathischer Guide. Sehr schöne Stimmung auf dem See. Es war ein wunderbarer Ausflug. Sehr zu empfehlen!" },
      { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-14", text: "Muchísimas gracias a mi guía y a Lee por la gran experiencia en estos 3 días. No me esperaba tan bonita acogida, enseñanza y un gran traslado a los 9 templos que vimos en los dos días. He podido conocer un poco del gran imperio Khemer , su religion y de su gran riqueza. Unas persona increíbles, en todo momento estuvieron al tanto de todo . Siempre con una gran sonrisa. El tercer día pude conocer un poco de los mercados locales , su gente y su gran gastronomía. El chef una persona maravillosa." },
    ],
  },
